{"name":"2014 Girly","title":"2014 Girly","revision":227155,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/2014_Girly","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The aesthetic resurfaced on social media app TikTok between late 2022 and reached its peak in summer 2024, following the \"2024 is the new 2014\" trend, due to users longing for the energy it gave."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The visuals in this aesthetic are girly: They include Victoria's Secret backstage photos, Starbucks drinks, cakes, and comfy rooms with floral bedsheets. The photos are usually edited with the \"Amaro\" filter on Instagram. In general, visuals include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Comfy silky pajamas"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande in her \"Yours Truly\" era"},{"kind":"list","text":"Starbucks drinks and cakes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Victoria's Secret white and pink luggage"},{"kind":"list","text":"Yankee Candles"},{"kind":"list","text":"UGG boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Maybelline \"Baby Skin\" makeup"},{"kind":"list","text":"Drinks with whipped cream and marshmallows (sweet drinks in general)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Photos taken from behind"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cute shower gel pics"},{"kind":"list","text":"Screenshots from old Tumblr celebs' blogs, like Madison Beer or Ariana Grande"},{"kind":"list","text":"Girls chilling with pink comfy pajamas and/or Starbucks drinks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cute phone cases for iPhone 4s"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The fashion is related to the Basic Girl, with more girly pieces like the Pink Cloud UGG boots, it can contain luxury pieces too, like the limited version Victoria's Secret silk pajamas. People, especially bloggers participating in the aesthetic, usually wear:"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Upper clothes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink cardigans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Comfy sweatshirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Victoria's Secret camisoles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace camisoles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pastel sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plain white t-shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Victoria's Secret dressing gowns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink winter jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"peplum tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"bustiers"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Underclothes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Black or grey leggings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Light-wash skinny jeans (for a really basic look)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sweatpants (especially in pink, grey and sometimes black)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace/girly undies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tennis skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim Jeans/shorts"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Pajamas"},{"kind":"list","text":"Silk pajamas (especially striped ones)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Victoria's Secret pajamas"},{"kind":"list","text":"Comfy pajamas with girly textures"},{"kind":"list","text":"brandy Melville pajamas"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pale pink dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"1950s inspired dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"white lace dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"floral dresses"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Shoes"},{"kind":"list","text":"White Converses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink UGG boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"White heels"},{"kind":"list","text":"ballet flats"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cat ear headbands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cute and girly backpacks/bags"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pastel and fluffy socks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pastel or light pink nail polish"},{"kind":"list","text":"EOS lipstick"},{"kind":"list","text":"Extremely big phone cases"},{"kind":"list","text":"White Sony headphones"},{"kind":"list","text":"Girly perfumes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Essie nail polish"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heart-shaped sunglasses"},{"kind":"list","text":"flower crowns"},{"kind":"list","text":"ted baker bags"},{"kind":"list","text":"\"Return to Tiffany\" heart necklaces"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Participants could take inspiration from Ariana's Grande outfits as well, such as wearing pastel mini-skirts, high heels, and crop tops."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Makeup"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The makeup is simple and easy, and often consists of the following:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Soft pink blush (ex. Dior Backstage)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Small amounts of of lipbalm/lipstick"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mascara"},{"kind":"list","text":"Concealer"},{"kind":"list","text":"Foundation is sometimes used for a more older look"},{"kind":"list","text":"A little bit of highlight"},{"kind":"list","text":"No contour"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chanel Perfumes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande's perfumes"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Food"},{"kind":"list","text":"Junk food (especially sweets and cakes)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cupcakes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Frappuccinos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Starbucks Pink Drinks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fruits"},{"kind":"list","text":"Whipped cream"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ice cream"},{"kind":"list","text":"hot chocolate with marshmallows or whipped cream"},{"kind":"list","text":"Arizona green tea"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Music is very important to this aesthetics' culture and is very similar to Pale Grunge."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lana Del Rey (\"Born to Die\" era)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"Selena Gomez"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande (\"Yours Truly\" era)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Melanie Martinez (\"Crybaby\" era)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Justin Bieber"},{"kind":"list","text":"MARINA"},{"kind":"list","text":"Becky G"},{"kind":"list","text":"Katy Perry"},{"kind":"list","text":"Demi Lovato"},{"kind":"list","text":"Miley Cyrus"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tove Lo"},{"kind":"list","text":"Charli XCX"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ellie Goulding (\"Love Me like You Do\")"},{"kind":"list","text":"5 Seconds of Summer"},{"kind":"list","text":"One Direction"},{"kind":"list","text":"Halsey"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chase Atlantic"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nicki Minaj"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lorde"},{"kind":"list","text":"Amy Winehouse (\"Back to Black\")"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sia"},{"kind":"list","text":"Zendaya"},{"kind":"list","text":"G-easy"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Decoration"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Participants of the 2014 Girly Tumblr aesthetic usually DIY their own decorations for their rooms, often taking inspiration from a well-known youtuber, Gabi DeMartino, a popular YouTube vlogger who made similar videos of this nature in 2013. Popular decorations include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flower decorations"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink tulle pieces"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cath Kidston bedsheets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink Yankee Candles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Patterned pillows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fluffy blankets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shabby Chic pieces"},{"kind":"list","text":"DIY poster collages"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fairy lights"},{"kind":"list","text":"Princess beds"},{"kind":"list","text":"Big makeup stands"},{"kind":"list","text":"white wire beds"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Though not everyone participates in them, people who follow this aesthetic often enjoy doing these activities:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watching old TV shows from the VHS era"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shopping"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cooking desserts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Listening to music"},{"kind":"list","text":"Going out with friends"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sleeping (or just chilling)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Doing your nails"},{"kind":"list","text":"Doing skincare"},{"kind":"list","text":"Journaling"},{"kind":"list","text":"Doing sports or just going to gym"},{"kind":"list","text":"Self-care"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading books"},{"kind":"list","text":"Studying"},{"kind":"list","text":"going to the beach"},{"kind":"list","text":"having relaxing baths"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Resources"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Vendors"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Victoria's Secret is the main store that fits this aesthetic, but they can also include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dior and Chanel"},{"kind":"list","text":"Maybelline"},{"kind":"list","text":"Essie"},{"kind":"list","text":"UGG"},{"kind":"list","text":"Abercrombie and Fitch"},{"kind":"list","text":"American Eagle"},{"kind":"list","text":"Adidas"},{"kind":"list","text":"All Star"},{"kind":"list","text":"Forever 21"},{"kind":"list","text":"Charlotte Russe"},{"kind":"list","text":"MAC"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pacsun"},{"kind":"list","text":"PINK"},{"kind":"list","text":"Glossier"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brandy Melville"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hollister"},{"kind":"list","text":"Kylie Cosmetics"},{"kind":"list","text":"Roller Rabbit"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cath Kidston"},{"kind":"list","text":"ted baker"},{"kind":"list","text":"lush"},{"kind":"list","text":"oh so heavenly"},{"kind":"list","text":"soap and glory"},{"kind":"heading","text":"YouTube videos"},{"kind":"list","text":"let's talk about the 2014 girly aesthetic - numberoneitgirl"},{"kind":"list","text":"spending a day like it's 2013 again... all the Bethany Mota vibes - Sara Baird"},{"kind":"list","text":"DIY Ariana Grande Room Decor! Cheap & Simple! - Nastazsa"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gabi's UPDATED 2014 Room Tour! - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"DIY valentino heels, closet tour, & I BOUGHT A HOUSE? - fancy vlogs by gab"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande - Home Tour (2012) [HD] - AriGrandeRecords"},{"kind":"list","text":"♡ Gabi's bow collection ♡ - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"DIY girly room decor ♡ - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"Relaxing Girly Vlog ♡ - Oops I Thrifted Again"},{"kind":"list","text":"Winter Primark Haul 2014 | Freddy My Love - Freddy My Love"},{"kind":"list","text":"Whats on my iPhone 2014 - Aimee Michelle"},{"kind":"list","text":"Room and Loft Tour! 2013 - Margaux Hakkaart"},{"kind":"list","text":"How To Make A Hair Bow - Christine Kobzeff"},{"kind":"list","text":"♡ Gabi's UPDATED \"Princess\" room tour! ♡ - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"Niki and Gabi Shopping Haul: Forever 21, MAC, Charlotte Russe - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande's Style Advice | Style Diaries - Seventeen"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ariana Grande - What's in my purse? - Seventeen"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bake With Us NikiandGabi & Sweetemelynes Baking With The Twins"},{"kind":"list","text":"tumblr aesthetics from the 2010s 🤓💻🎀- ModernGurlz"},{"kind":"list","text":"Healthy Snack Ideas! ♡ - Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"Spring 2014 trends + Outfit Inspiration with Niki and Gabi"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gabi's New Workout Routine ♡ - Niki and Gabi"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/d/d3/%E2%84%93%CF%85%CE%B7%CE%B1_%D0%BC%CE%B9_%CE%B1%CE%B7g%D1%94%E2%84%93_%E2%99%A1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240921191735","caption":"ℓυηα мι αηgєℓ ♡","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:%E2%84%93%CF%85%CE%B7%CE%B1_%D0%BC%CE%B9_%CE%B1%CE%B7g%D1%94%E2%84%93_%E2%99%A1.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0009-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/3/36/Rosytumblrbloggirly.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240921193857","caption":"2014 Girly · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Rosytumblrbloggirly.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0009-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}